# Hillsbrad Foothills, Alliance 30 to ~32, then Stormwind and Ironforge: the
# first guide of the 30-40 band.
#
# Flow: Southshore (Farren's murlocs and naga, the turtles, the Syndicate camp
# on the Alterac border, the yeti cave) -> fly to Stormwind for a round of
# turn-ins and the Missing Diplomat chain (Druids train there) -> Deeprun
# Tram to Ironforge for Stormpike, the Reclaimers and class training -> next
# guide: Desolace.
#
# Deviations from the simulator route (consensus, Alliance Human):
# - Every Southshore quest is picked up on arrival instead of after Farren's
#   chain: same hub, no extra walk.
# - Stormwind: the turn-ins run as one loop (Trade District, Old Town, the
#   Keep, the Cathedral, the Mage Quarter, back through the Trade District to
#   the tram). The route's Stormwind bind and its hearth back into the same
#   city are dropped: the next bind (Nijel's Point) replaces it before use.
# - The route binds at Nijel's Point while still in Ironforge (a model
#   shortcut): the bind is in the next guide, on arrival.
# Carried on to later guides: Costly Menace (564), Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak
# (565), Hints of a New Plague? (659), An Alarming Request (92432), Noble
# Deaths (512), Further Mysteries (525), Malin's Request (690), James Hyal
# (1301), The Doomed Fleet (270) and The Missing Diplomat (1248), all turned
# in later on the route.
# Class quests: Warriors take The Islander (1718) from Wu Shen in Stormwind;
# Fray Island lies on the ride to Ratchet in 40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale,
# where Big Will (level 33) is no longer a risk. Warlocks: Seeking Strahad
# and the Felhunter's Tome of the Cabal (1798 onwards) are not taken: the
# chain runs Stormwind, Ratchet, Ironforge, Hillsbrad, Thousand Needles or
# the southern Barrens, the Wetlands and Ratchet again, and with this route's
# own stops it would finish near level 50.
# Left out: A Noble Brew (335, 336): a cellar stop and a walk to the Keep's
# far side for little XP; dropped for flow.
# Not here: Return to Milton (542), Dark Council (537) and Stormpike's
# Deciphering (554) cannot be taken in this guide: their prerequisites (540,
# 525, 551) are turned in later, in 05-arathi-highlands, which carries all
# three.
guide forever/alliance/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills
title Hillsbrad Foothills, Ironforge & Stormwind City
faction Alliance
levels 30-32
zone Hillsbrad Foothills
next forever/alliance/30-40/02-desolace

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Southshore

step Southshore
  tip Pick up everything in town before heading out; Farren stands outside the inn, Maleb in the town hall.
  accept 536                          -- Lieutenant Farren Orinelle
  accept 555                          -- Chef Jessen
  buy 3713 x1 npc 2381                -- Soothing Spices, from Micha Yance
  accept 659                          -- Phin Odelic: his trail leads to Arathi
  # An Alarming Request requires level 30 (Wowhead Forever quest=92432, checked 2026-10-14).
  accept 92432 "An Alarming Request" npc 247264 lvl 30 -- Emissary Jacques
  accept 505                          -- Magistrate Henry Maleb
  accept 565                          -- Bartolo Ginsetti
  accept 564                          -- Darren Malvew: the lions come later

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The coast

step Torn Fin murlocs
  tip The Torn Fin murlocs crowd the Western Strand, south-west of Southshore.
  kill 2377 quest 536.1               -- Torn Fin Tidehunter
  kill 2376 quest 536.2               -- Torn Fin Oracle

step Farren
  turnin 536
  accept 559

step Murloc heads
  tip Back to the same murlocs; not every one drops a head.
  collect 3716 quest 559              -- Murloc Head

step Farren's Proof
  turnin 559                          -- Lieutenant Farren Orinelle
  accept 560
  turnin 560                          -- Marshal Redpath
  accept 561
  turnin 561                          -- Lieutenant Farren Orinelle
  accept 562

step Daggerspine naga
  tip The naga hold the shore south-east of Southshore.
  kill 2369 quest 562.1               -- Daggerspine Shorehunter
  kill 2371 quest 562.2               -- Daggerspine Siren

step Farren
  turnin 562
  accept 563                          -- A report for Stormwind Keep

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North of Southshore

step Snapjaws
  tip The Snapjaw turtles bask along the river east of Southshore, south of Tarren Mill (Horde).
  collect 3712 quest 555              -- Turtle Meat

step Syndicate camp
  tip The Syndicate camp sits on the Alterac border in northern Hillsbrad, west of Tarren Mill (Horde); the documents lie in the camp.
  kill 2241 quest 505.2               -- Syndicate Thief
  kill 2240 quest 505.1               -- Syndicate Footpad
  accept 510 object 1738              -- Syndicate Documents
  accept 511 object 1738

step Yeti cave
  tip The yetis live in the cave in the hills north of Southshore, on your way back south.
  collect 3720 quest 565.3            -- Yeti Fur
  note Bartolo also wants a Hillman's Cloak, a Bolt of Woolen Cloth and Fine Thread: crafted or bought; the cloak is turned in when you are back in Southshore later.

step Southshore
  turnin 555                          -- Chef Jessen
  turnin 511                          -- Loremaster Dibbs
  accept 514
  turnin 505                          -- Magistrate Henry Maleb
  turnin 510
  accept 512

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stormwind

step Fly to Stormwind
  zone Stormwind City
  fly "Stormwind"                     -- From Darla Harris in Southshore

step Elling Trias
  tip The cheese shop in the Trade District.
  turnin 1245
  accept 1246

step Dashel Stonefist
  tip Dashel waits in the Pig and Whistle tavern in Old Town; he and his two thugs fight you, but stop once beaten.
  turnin 1246
  accept 1447
  complete 1447
  turnin 1447
  accept 1247

step The Islander
  only Warrior
  tip Wu Shen trains warriors in Old Town, beside the Pig and Whistle. Klannoc Macleod waits on Fray Island in the Barrens, on the way to Ratchet much later (40-50/01).
  accept 1718 npc 5479                -- Wu Shen

step Stormwind Keep
  turnin 563                          -- Major Samuelson

step Cathedral of Light
  turnin 293                          -- Archbishop Benedictus
  turnin 269                          -- Bishop Farthing
  accept 270

step Mage Quarter
  tip Archmage Malin is in the Slaughtered Lamb; Garion Wendell near the canal; Connor Rivers south of the Mage Quarter.
  accept 690                          -- Archmage Malin
  accept 79536                        -- Garion Wendell
  turnin 79536
  accept 1301                         -- Connor Rivers

step Elling Trias
  turnin 1247
  accept 1248

step Druid training
  only Druid
  tip Ironforge has no druid trainer: train with Sheldras Moontree in Stormwind before the tram.
  train class

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ironforge

step Deeprun Tram
  zone Ironforge
  tip Take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge.
  turnin 514                          -- Prospector Stormpike, Hall of Explorers
  accept 525
  accept 1453                         -- Roetten Stonehammer
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock -- Level 30 and 32 spells
